        <activityName xml:lang="en">Gravel, round, market mix, at regional storage, with resource correction</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Gravel, round, market mix, at regional storage, with resource correction
pipeline transport is modelled as freight train transport.;
UUID: e12ff86b-8450-39a9-981a-87f823201fce
This data set accounts for 1 kg of gravel at the regional storage. 19% are from import, 81% are produced in Switzerland. The imported goods are delievered to Switzerland to 36% from Germany, 26% from Italy 23% from France and 14% from Austria. 13% are delievered by freight train, 78% by lorry and 8% by barge. The resource correction for recycled gravel (assumed share: 90%) is also included.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: undefined
Time period: undefined
Production volume: CH consumption of gravel and sand: 44'510 kt
Sampling: statistical data 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e12ff86b-8450-39a9-981a-87f823201fce.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
